# Every course is a top-level folder; these rules apply inside each one.

# Source material used to make bench libraries (STEP models and the like): never loaded by a bench, kept on disk only
# (owner, 2026-10-20: "every file put in resources should be ignored"). Both spellings: PBL2026's is resoureces.
/*/resoureces/
/*/resources/

# Film frames: stills only since 2026-10-11 (owner: "no need for films, just stills going forward")
/*/**/film/

# Staging folders left by a move or a decoupling; nothing in them belongs to the course
/*/_decoupled-*/
/*/_moved-*/

# Scratch
*.log
__pycache__/
.tmp*/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
